            <ArticleTitle>On &quot;ratio scales of sensory and affective verbal pain descriptors&quot;.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The cross-modality matching methods of Stevens [16] have been used by Gracely and his colleagues [4-6] to provide numerical values for &quot;verbal pain descriptors.&quot; These numerical values, it is claimed, provide reliable, objective and valid ratio-level measurement of the sensory and affective dimensions of pain. Each of these claims is critically examined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
